LineageOS 15.1 sepolicy split — platform (system partition) side.

In Oreo the build system routes BOARD_PLAT_SEPOLICY_DIRS into the
platform policy compiled into /system/etc/selinux/plat_*.  This
directory currently contains no device-specific platform overrides;
all m681 policy additions live in the sibling flat files
(../audioserver.te, ../cameraserver.te, etc.) which the build system
continues to pick up via BOARD_SEPOLICY_DIRS.

When a full Treble split is needed, move platform-only .te files here
and vendor-only .te files to ../vendor/.
